{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "useDefineForClassFields": true,
    "lib": ["ES2022", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "module": "ESNext",
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "strict": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": true,
    "paths": {
      "@datazen/backend-client": ["./packages/backend-client/src/index.ts"],
      "@datazen/driver-sdk": ["./packages/driver-sdk/src/index.ts"],
      "@datazen/extension-points": ["./packages/extension-points/src/index.ts"],
      "@datazen/wapp-sdk": ["./packages/wapp-sdk/src/index.ts"],
      "@datazen/extension-sdk": ["./packages/wapp-sdk/src/index.ts"],
      "@datazen/ui": ["./packages/ui/src/index.ts"]
    }
  },
  "include": [
    "src",
    "packages/backend-client",
    "packages/driver-sdk",
    "packages/extension-points",
    "packages/wapp-sdk",
    "packages/ui",
    "packages/drivers/clickhouse/ui",
    "packages/drivers/duckdb/ui",
    "packages/drivers/elasticsearch/ui",
    "packages/drivers/hbase/ui",
    "packages/drivers/influxdb/ui",
    "packages/drivers/mongodb/ui",
    "packages/drivers/mysql/ui",
    "packages/drivers/postgres/ui",
    "packages/drivers/redis/ui",
    "packages/drivers/rqlite/ui",
    "packages/drivers/sqlite/ui",
    "packages/drivers/sqlserver/ui",
    "packages/drivers/turso/ui",
    "packages/drivers/vector/ui",
    "packages/drivers/victoriametrics/ui"
  ],
  "exclude": ["**/__boundaryProbe__*", "**/__uiBoundaryProbe__*"],
  "$comment": [
    "The exclude above keeps the reserved probe files out of this program.",
    "A guard test plants a throwaway probe in the working tree to prove a",
    "layer rule is armed, and deletes it again. If tsc's program contains such",
    "a file, two things go wrong: the probe's body is not necessarily valid",
    "TypeScript (it names modules the package does not depend on), and the",
    "probe can be deleted between tsc listing the file and reading it, which",
    "is TS6053. Both failures belong to the probe, not to the tree.",
    "packages/ui/tsconfig.json and packages/backend-client/tsconfig.json carry",
    "the same exclude: fixing only the root config leaves the per-package",
    "programs able to see a probe."
  ],
  "references": [{ "path": "./tsconfig.node.json" }]
}
